  "Name": {
    "_note": "Which PARTY a name belongs to. Two-party transaction sheets (DP 3.xlsx, DP Emails 2.xlsx, JBR-Remram..., The Villa '17) put a seller and a buyer on the same row, each with their own nationality, contact and email. The 23-field schema has one Name slot, so one party wins it and the other is preserved in extras. Which party SHOULD win is a business question the data cannot answer -- see ADR-004 -- so the role is recorded and the choice flagged rather than decided silently.",
    "target_column": "name",
    "default_type": null,
    "min_confidence": 0.7,
    "types": [
